### =====================================================================
### 7. MATERIAS
### =====================================================================

### 7.1 Listar materias
GET {{baseUrl}}/materias?page=1&limit=10&search=&carreraId=&tipoEspacio=MATERIA
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7.2 Materias por carrera
GET {{baseUrl}}/materias/carrera/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7.3 Obtener por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/materias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7.4 Correlatividades de una materia
GET {{baseUrl}}/materias/1/correlatividades
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7.5 Crear materia
POST {{baseUrl}}/materias
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Análisis Matemático I",
  "descripcion": "Cálculo diferencial e integral",
  "codigo": "MAT-101",
  "cargaHoraria": 90,
  "horasCatedra": "6h semanales",
  "tipoEspacio": "MATERIA",
  "modalidad": "PRESENCIAL",
  "periodo": "ANUAL",
  "regimen": "REGULAR_PRESENCIAL_PROMOCION",
  "notaMinima": 6,
  "asistenciaRequerida": 75,
  "tpRequeridos": 75,
  "esPromocionable": true,
  "notaPromocion": 8,
  "aniosRegularidad": 3,
  "carreraId": 1,
  "cursoId": null,
  "espacioCurricularId": null
}

### 7.6 Actualizar materia
PUT {{baseUrl}}/materias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cargaHoraria": 100,
  "esPromocionable": false
}

### 7.7 Agregar correlatividad a la materia 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/materias/1/correlatividades
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materiaRequeridaId": 2,
  "tipoRequisito": "OBLIGATORIA",
  "grupo": null,
  "cantidadMinimaAprobadas": null,
  "aplicaCursado": true,
  "aplicaRendir": true
}

### 7.8 Eliminar correlatividad por su ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/materias/correlatividades/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7.9 Eliminar materia
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/materias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 8. INSCRIPCIONES A CARRERAS
### =====================================================================

### 8.1 Inscribir alumno a carrera
POST {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-carreras
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alumnoId": 1,
  "carreraId": 1,
  "cicloLectivo": 2026
}

### 8.2 Dar de baja inscripción a carrera
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-carreras/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8.3 Inscripciones de un alumno
GET {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-carreras/alumno/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8.4 Inscriptos de una carrera
GET {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-carreras/carrera/1/inscriptos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 9. INSCRIPCIONES A MATERIAS
### =====================================================================

### 9.1 Materias disponibles para el alumno (alumno usa su propio ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias/disponibles?cicloLectivo=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
### (para admin: ?alumnoId=1&cicloLectivo=2026)

### 9.2 Verificar si el alumno puede inscribirse a la materia 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias/verificar/1?cicloLectivo=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
### (para admin: ?alumnoId=1&cicloLectivo=2026)

### 9.3 Inscribir alumno a materia (alumno = él mismo; admin puede indicar alumnoId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alumnoId": 1,
  "materiaId": 1,
  "cicloLectivo": 2026
}

### 9.4 Dar de baja inscripción a materia
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9.5 Materias de un alumno
GET {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias/alumno/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9.6 Inscriptos de una materia
GET {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias/materia/1/inscriptos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9.7 Historial de un alumno en una materia
GET {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias/historial/1/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9.8 Cambiar modalidad de cursada (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/inscripciones-materias/1/modalidad
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modalidad": "SEMIPRESENCIAL"
}

### =====================================================================
### 10. EXÁMENES
### =====================================================================

### 10.1 Listar exámenes (filtros opcionales)
GET {{baseUrl}}/examenes?page=1&limit=10&materiaId=1&fechaDesde=2026-01-01&fechaHasta=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10.2 Obtener examen por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/examenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10.3 Crear examen (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/examenes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materiaId": 1,
  "fecha": "2026-07-15T14:00:00.000Z",
  "tipoExamen": "ESCRITO",
  "llamado": 1,
  "folio": "F-2026-001",
  "libro": "L-2026-001"
}

### 10.4 Actualizar examen (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/examenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "llamado": 2,
  "tipoExamen": "ORAL"
}

### 10.5 Eliminar examen (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/examenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10.6 Agregar tribunal al examen (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/examenes/tribunales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "examenId": 1,
  "profesorId": 1,
  "rolTribunal": "PRESIDENTE"
}

### 10.7 Quitar tribunal (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/examenes/tribunales/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10.8 Inscribir alumno al examen 1 (alumno usa su propio ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/examenes/1/inscribir
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alumnoId": 1,
  "condicion": "REGULAR"
}

### 10.9 Desinscribir alumno del examen 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/examenes/1/desinscribir
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alumnoId": 1
}

### 10.10 Inscriptos del examen 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/examenes/1/inscriptos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10.11 Inscripciones de un alumno
GET {{baseUrl}}/examenes/alumno/1/inscripciones
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10.12 Registrar nota a un alumno en el examen 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/examenes/1/calificacion
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alumnoId": 1,
  "nota": 8
}

